<title>USA: U.S. supply/demand soybean product estimates--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. supply/demand soybean product estimates--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA supply/demand soybean product estimates (Oil in million bls, Meal in 1,000 short tons):</p>
<p>    Soybean Oil ----- 1996/97		 1995/96</p>
<p>    -		11/01/96  10/01/96  11/01/96  10/01/96</p>
<p> Beginning Stocks   2,007   2,010	 1,137   1,137</p>
